<div class="container" style="padding-bottom:64px"><div class="prose">
  <div class="page-title"><h1>Privacy policy</h1></div>
  <p>This policy explains what information <%= settings.store_name %> collects and how it is used.</p>
  <h2>Information we collect</h2>
  <ul><li>Account and order details: name, email, phone number, delivery address, and order history.</li><li>Messages you send us through the contact form or feedback forms.</li><li>Basic technical data such as cookies needed to keep you signed in and your bag saved.</li></ul>
  <h2>How we use it</h2>
  <ul><li>To process and deliver your orders, and send order updates.</li><li>To respond to your questions and provide support.</li><li>To send marketing emails only if you subscribe, and you can unsubscribe at any time.</li></ul>
  <h2>Payments</h2>
  <p>Online payments are handled by secure third-party gateways (such as Razorpay or Stripe). We never see or store your full card details, UPI PIN, or netbanking credentials.</p>
  <h2>Sharing</h2>
  <p>We share your name, address and phone number with courier partners only to deliver your order. We do not sell your personal data.</p>
  <h2>Your choices</h2>
  <p>You can update your details in your account, or contact us at <a class="link" href="mailto:<%= settings.email %>"><%= settings.email %></a> to request access to, correction of, or deletion of your data.</p>
</div></div>
